  "description": "Kun Framework sandbox abstraction for C# business services: ISandboxProvider whose shape mirrors the E2B v2 REST API (templateId / cpuCount / memoryMB / timeoutMs / envs / metadata / neuroagent extension), with pluggable backends — InMemory (test), Supervisor (neuroagent-python /v2/sandboxes/*), and E2B Cloud (skeleton for Phase 2+). Abstraction + client only; the runtime lives in neuroagent-python/sandbox_supervisor.",
